# Mob programs from the fixture area in a fight, with area_update and violence_update running, in the temple
# square (3005). The sparring partner (30002, 5) has a program for each fight trigger.
# - kill: Decimus (10) attacks it, and it answers
# - fight: each round it fights, it speaks
# - surr: Decimus surrenders, and it accepts
# - hpcnt 60: Heroic (51) attacks it, and under 60% of its hit points it says so
# - death: it dies, and says its last
@place mobprog.are mobprog.are
@place area-mobprog.lst area.lst
@updates area,violence
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
south
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@mob 30002 3005
@as dec
kill partner
@pulse until 60 Take that
surrender
@pulse 24
@as hero
kill partner
@pulse until 400 is DEAD
@state
